  "remaining_blocker": "The half-maximum positive-DM decay condition is too sparse and not economically transportable. It fired only twice in BTC development OOS and never in ETH; one BTC exit avoided an immediate loss but the other omitted profitable recovery, while the sole BTC training exit omitted a large positive continuation. The family therefore cannot establish bilateral breadth or uncertainty-supported superiority.",
